  "contentHtml": "<p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">거울 단원에 &#39;학교에 설치하고 싶은 거울 제안하기&#39;라는 제목으로 &lt;해보기&gt;가 나오는 교과서가 있지요.</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">생기발랄, 리액션 갑인 1학년 아이들의 탐구 결과물을 올립니다.</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">작업은 포스트잇에 하였고요. 한 친구는 별도의 색지를 요청하더니 볼록거울과 오목거울을 동시에 활용하는 방안을 제안하였습니다.</span></p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8bee9b55590391697953e54d2a1a99871000d282\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8bee9b55590391697953e54d2a1a99871000d282\" data-origin-width=\"4032\" data-origin-height=\"3024\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/be6ff63c1ffd9f46e2af7343b8e62b5ec1432160\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/be6ff63c1ffd9f46e2af7343b8e62b5ec1432160\" data-origin-width=\"3024\" data-origin-height=\"4032\"></div><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9134908e9677f78213cd8f16665ed9621d5d49b8\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9134908e9677f78213cd8f16665ed9621d5d49b8\" data-origin-width=\"3507\" data-origin-height=\"2480\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4485aac6ecd850da758b4d11ccd9b0c30e9161a9\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4485aac6ecd850da758b4d11ccd9b0c30e9161a9\" data-origin-width=\"4032\" data-origin-height=\"3024\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCe